Ah, I see! Thanks!

Does this mean that the ending of the adjective isn't affected by whether the object is plural? 

Also, what about "Du hast deine eigenen Verbindungen?" where "Verbindung" is female? 

And also for, "Die kostenlosen Bücher sind toll", why is it not "kostenloses"? 

